# forced-patch

Use when a task is stuck: the suite still fails and the agent has spent several turns reading
files without a fix. Do not browse. One call, one edit, then verify.

- Target must be a real source file from the provided list; tests/ is never edited.
- Prefer the smallest change at the traced line/function.
- After the edit the whole suite is re-run; a regression is reverted automatically.
- If the same function was already changed with no effect, change a different location.
